  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JRS Romania Capacity Strengthening &amp; Advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant to cover Capacity Strengthening and Advocacy activities at JRS Romania between 2025 and 2028, with a goal of leaving JRS Romania in a strong position to sustain activities independently when CAFOD&apos;s Ukraine Programme ends in March 2028. Activities will take into account recommendations developed under previous Organisational Development consultancy support facilitated by CAFOD as well as Advocacy Strategy development support facilitated by CAFOD. Funding will be released in successive approvals as action plan and budget are developed iteratively.</narrative>
  </description>
